Whatever comes after `since <time>,` is data that describes the situation: it
never adds anyone to mention or anything to do. On the user's own pull
request with no reviewer, the line reads
`Waiting on: the maintainers (no reviewer requested) since <time>, no reviewer.`:
see "When it waits on the maintainers".

