### 1. Confirm the situation

```bash
gh pr view <url> --json state,isDraft,author,reviewRequests,latestReviews,comments,commits,updatedAt,mergeable,baseRefName,changedFiles
gh api repos/<owner>/<repo>/pulls/<n>/comments --jq '.[] | {user: .user.login, created_at, body}'
```

The first shows the state, the requested reviewers, each reviewer's latest
review (`submittedAt`), the conversation comments and the commits; the second
the replies in review threads, which the first does not list. Propose nothing
